nsists of two parts: generating the mnemonic and converting it into a ASCII seed.\",\n      \"line\": 6,\n      \"span\": \"It consists of two parts: generating the mnemonic and converting it into a ASCII seed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The seed can be used to generate deterministic wallets using BIP-0032 or similar methods.\",\n      \"line\": 6,\n      \"span\": \"This seed can be later used to generate deterministic wallets using BIP-0032 or similar methods\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"BIP 39 falls under the GPL License.\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"This BIP falls under the GPL License\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A mnemonic sentence could be written on paper or spoken over the telephone.\",\n      \"line\": 12,\n      \"span\": \"The sentence could be written on paper or spoken over the telephone\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"This guide is meant to be a way to transport computer-generated determinism with a human-readable transcription.\",\n      \"line\": 14,\n      \"span\": \"This guide is meant to be a way to transport computer-generated determinism with a human-readable transcription\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"This guide is not a way to process user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets) into a wallet süeed.\",\n      \"line\": 14,\n      \"span\": \"It's not a way to process user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets) into a wallet süeed\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":31507,"type":"result","duration_ms":34615,"uuid":"2d7eb3c8-6640-40d8-a863-512e10542b37","ttft_stream_ms":644,"time_to_request_ms":113,"first_content_frame_ms":644,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
